    text: "'await' here changes nothing: an async function waits for the Promise it returns; leave out 'await'",
  },
  [Code.FieldsNotSet]: {
    text: "the constructor of '{first}' does not set field '{word}' on every path; set it on every path, or make it optional: '{word}?: T'",
